# Hardware-only: same musical fixture, forced foreground stalls, IRQs enabled.
# No host interaction during playback; every stall has room to finish before
# the next scheduled action. Compare MIDI queue age, wake age and timer gaps.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
0 marker isolation_root
20 assert_view MACRO
40 assert_mode macro.performance
100 transport start
2000 marker block_100ms
2030 block_foreground 100
2500 assert_mode macro.performance
4000 marker block_250ms
4030 block_foreground 250
4500 assert_mode macro.performance
6000 marker block_1000ms
6030 block_foreground 1000
7500 assert_mode macro.performance
9000 transport stop
